   <title>Support Contact Form</title>
   <style>
     :root {
       color-scheme: light;
       --bg: #f4f7fb;
       --card: #ffffff;
       --text: #162033;
       --muted: #62708a;
       --line: #d9e2ef;
       --primary: #2869ff;
